      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebweeni wa Wele ne Yesu Kristo, oolikhalakila balamu ne bafu, lundi sikila alikho echa khukhwamiia nga Omwami, ese khuchuuba lukali ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "boola burume obwo. Obe ne sinani sie khukiboola (siise siakhaba ne sili silayi namwe tawe), yilwacha khusuubisia, khurafwira ne khuraamo kumwoyo nga ne wekisia ne liliefwiilisia likali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siise silecha nisio babaandu bakhalekhe khuloonda kamekisio kamalayi, mala baloonde lilienya liabwe ne khutasa khukhwerao babekisia bakali balibaboolela niko bebeene bekoomba khuulila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakhalekhe khurekeeresia bung'ali mala barekeeresie chingano busa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali okhoya weliinda mu buli siindu, yikhaliilikha mu butinyu, khola kimilimo kio mwilwachi owe Elomo Endayi, lundi khola kimilimo kiowo kioosi nga omukholi owa Wele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwise, siise siase sie khurusibwa nga embosio siolile. Siise siase sie khurura mu bulamu buno nisio sino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Napaane liie bulayi namalile chimbilo chase lundi naliindile lisuubila liase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono kumuruuru kwe bukhili mu khuba omuluungi ebweeni wa Wele kwanindile, kumuruuru nikwo Omwami, omukhalaki omuluungi, akhambelesie khu Ndaalo eyo, ne se ndi ese seng'ene tawe, akhaba khwaabo boosi baliindiilila mu busiime khukhwicha khwewe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Likhuwa liase khwiwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
